# Spotify data rules

- **Never read, open, diff, or edit `.env.local` (or other secret env files).** Use [`.env.example`](../../.env.example) as the proxy for env names and comments. Tell the human which keys to set; do not load real values. If a task seems to need `.env.local`, stop and ask them to paste a redacted snippet or confirm the key name only.
- Agent memory (soul / scars / decisions): read [SOUL.md](SOUL.md) and [agent-memory.mdc](agent-memory.mdc). The file is the memory, not the conversation.
- Read [docs/DATA.md](docs/DATA.md) and [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before changing ingest or analytics.
- Before changing Scrapped deck order, slide copy, or share-card framing, read [docs/WRAPPED.md](docs/WRAPPED.md); keep Wrapped’s beat spine; invert meaning, don’t scramble pacing. API story voice: conversational text-first (see mocks + API spine in WRAPPED.md). `/scrapped` slide copy lives in `ApiScrappedDeck.tsx`.
- Before changing story motion / list stagger / progress timing, read WRAPPED.md §10, [docs/mocks/wrapped-ref/](docs/mocks/wrapped-ref/), and [D-001](docs/decisions/D-001-story-copy-vs-list-motion.md) (shared copy motion; only the 5-row list is special). Match Wrapped form; do not clone Wrapped art.
- `ts` is the stream **end** time (UTC). Derive start as `ts - ms_played`.
- Never commit, log, or render `ip_addr`. Strip it at ingest.
- Do not use `skipped` alone for historical skips; it is unreliable before ~2022. Combine with `reason_end` (`fwdbtn`, `endplay`, `backbtn`) and short `ms_played`.
- Prefer `sum(ms_played)` over raw play counts for rankings and Scrapped Plus export features.
- Music entity key: `spotify_track_uri` (fallback title + artist).
- Keep `data/raw/` and `data/processed/` gitignored.
- Spotify Web API is for Scrapped, Scrapped Lab, and Liked enrichment on Plus; use `src/lib/spotify` server-side only; never expose access tokens to the client.
- Export history remains the source of truth for skips on `/scrapped/plus`. Scrapped / Scrapped Lab use tops/library proxies only.
